# Components

<FrameworkTabs />

Weather, moon, and tide components for {framework} that inherit your {framework === 'React' ? 'shadcn/ui' : 'shadcn-svelte'} theme, base components, and icon library.

## Time zones

All cards default to the visitor’s browser time zone after hydration (UTC during server rendering). Pass an IANA `timeZone` prop, such as `timeZone="America/Chicago"`, to override it. `ForecastDashboard` forwards this prop to all three cards. Location coordinates and the provider’s time zone remain separate from the display time zone.

